---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for recoverRequirements. Read the supplied handover specification, asset schedules, and contractual requirements to identify required documents, tests, training, and approvals. Separate documentary requirements from technical sign-off and preserve conditions specific to asset classes or building areas. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
